.TH TEST-ALL 1 "September 2026" "Kagi 0.38.0" "Developer Commands"
.SH NAME
test-all \- run the standard Kagi validation suite
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B scripts/test-all
.SH DESCRIPTION
Runs rustfmt check, cargo check, unit tests, and Clippy. Set STRICT=1 to deny warnings. If nvcc is present, it also validates the optional CUDA feature.
